a: TLR, NK, macrófagos","guid":"oYd0B8dTREKFDU7AzM3bKg","children":[]}]},{"id":"67","parent":"62","text":"FASE 2 - Respuesta autoinmune (dias 4-14)","guid":"rXLW7iu9TIKMQa2FynsP0A","children":[{"id":"68","parent":"67","text":"Linfocitos T citotoxicos CD8+ atacan miocitos","guid":"u7Ic91EORXOl-eIZI9KKsg","children":[]},{"id":"69","parent":"67","text":"Mimetismo molecular: anticuerpos anti-miocardio","guid":"Y2tmiBE_TiCH002tV54skw","children":[]},{"id":"70","parent":"67","text":"Liberacion de citocinas proinflamatorias (IL-1, IL-6, TNF-alfa)","guid":"Y62oMBIrR2u2Zmzu756iwg","children":[]},{"id":"71","parent":"67","text":"Proteinas liberadas: troponina I y T, CK-MB","guid":"ww1MY79ORJizlT-ksRymXQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"72","parent":"62","text":"FASE 3 - Cronica/resolucion (semanas-meses)","guid":"hZnpn2inRa2Sb62YLEhHBw","children":[{"id":"73","parent":"72","text":"Resolucion completa (50-70% casos virales leves)","guid":"3eBgJT5NR5ud1lOGeNOwTw","children":[]},{"id":"74","parent":"72","text":"Remodelacion con fibrosis -> cardiomiopatia dilatada (20-30%)","guid":"Ym_6XzuJQXOIJJWDb7ZpPQ","children":[]},{"id":"75","parent":"72","text":"Activacion cromica SRAA + SNS -> disfuncion VI progresiva","guid":"JNka_lcuSCmJiQTOxeCbqw","children":[]}]},{"id":"76","parent":"62","text":"MECANISMO ICI","guid":"bGoM9ngtT5OHheZOUrY0mg","children":[{"id":"77","parent":"76","text":"Activacion excesiva linfocitos T -> lesion miocardica autoinmune","guid":"HSZMPspLTEaMcXMau-vBsg","children":[]},{"id":"78","parent":"76","text":"Similar a rechazo de trasplante","guid":"RiJp6_zrQWiRLHZHa0XsMQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"79","parent":"62","text":"MECANISMO VACUNA ARNm","guid":"jqPERxOaRAeOGtLVB9ZyOw","children":[{"id":"80","parent":"79","text":"Respuesta inmune exagerada mediada por celulas T o anticuerpos","guid":"iCrEtPL8R4W5gXciApwi7A","children":[]},{"id":"81","parent":"79","text":"NO es miocarditis viral directa","guid":"6Pb98bipQgiQkc8BJpQYIg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"82","parent":"0","text":"Clinica","guid":"26UiBlirSnWlRdRt_a_AYw","children":[{"id":"83","parent":"82","text":"ESPECTRO AMPLIO (de subClinica a fulminante)","guid":"rlI7X1nWTRKXGOviCNoxOw","children":[]},{"id":"84","parent":"82","text":"SUBLINICA","guid":"Jp4BtPgsR0GisWC9rJD0_w","children":[{"id":"85","parent":"84","text":"Asintomatica + elevacion troponina incidental","guid":"wHgSchTBTAuYtVToOtxp3Q","children":[]},{"id":"86","parent":"84","text":"Puede descubrirse en imagen por otra causa","guid":"vroyHIfDSJSzyedzYxLnyQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"87","parent":"82","text":"PSEUDO-IAM (MAS COMUN EN JOVENES)","guid":"b16UBc5FRAOLKps65Jjbvg","children":[{"id":"88","parent":"87","text":"Dolor toracico + elevacion troponina + supradesnivel ST en ECG","guid":"KB70_OcASsWA_juqPv-tPQ","children":[]},{"id":"89","parent":"87","text":"Coronariografia NORMAL - clave diagnostica","guid":"HWZKWERmTIu8kWZV3I2lzA","children":[]},{"id":"90","parent":"87","text":"Distribución LGE no isquemica en RM","guid":"Waz_Yd8HRf2zNH0or3wMtg","children":[]}]},{"id":"91","parent":"82","text":"INSUFICIENCIA CARDIACA (aguda o subaguda)","guid":"2k2yrMarRD2Xs-F6JyqNgQ","children":[{"id":"92","parent":"91","text":"Disnea, fatiga, ortopnea","guid":"DZjsk_aRQCinsJBnk_ylpQ","children":[]},{"id":"93","parent":"91","text":"Disfuncion VI moderada-severa","guid":"GJptsoTUQkKuIRT-Od51nA","children":[]},{"id":"94","parent":"91","text":"BNP/NT-proBNP elevados","guid":"Y1T_NwNGT2KDSjIqWyuyIg","children":[]}]},{"id":"95","parent":"82","text":"ARRITMIAS","guid":"N4wH22ejSkm9usrYd5dRKA","children":[{"id":"96","parent":"95","text":"Taquicardia ventricular (TV) monomorfa o polimorfa","guid":"D4R15oLaSmGucWLJCWkumg","children":[]},{"id":"97","parent":"95","text":"Fibrilacion ventricular (FV)","guid":"r0QVPTn1SP-PQw24ZNTALg","children":[]},{"id":"98","parent":"95","text":"Bloqueo auriculoventricular completo (Lyme, celulas gigantes)","guid":"JzjkfYNXQTenpom-vZ9rQg","children":[]},{"id":"99","parent":"95","text":"Bloqueo de rama","guid":"RtdiYDamQTGD2tgdOy585g","children":[]}]},{"id":"100","parent":"82","text":"MUERTE SUBITA CARDIACA","guid":"z1ap9YzATsKI4QtscBpnkg","children":[{"id":"101","parent":"100","text":"~10% de muertes subitas en jovenes son por miocarditis","guid":"UQcCHx8SQ4yMZex7yzJq1Q","children":[]},{"id":"102","parent":"100","text":"Frecuentemente primer sintoma","guid":"NpbJvySVSpC4TkSvY-5YcA","children":[]}]},{"id":"103","parent":"82","text":"FULMINANTE (5-10% de casos)","guid":"TJFXUKSHTSu0redOFMZpGg","children":[{"id":"104","parent":"103","text":"Shock cardiogenico","guid":"YuazHZnnRLmvIO7l3sXSLA","children":[]},{"id":"105","parent":"103","text":"FEVI muy deprimida en dias","guid":"y6l1ZTYbSdyPxPMW3TNlDA","children":[]},{"id":"106","parent":"103","text":"Paradoja: si sobrevive fase aguda, pronóstico a largo plazo MEJOR que no-fulminante","guid":"-nlnqAP0Qem1fl2I6Xp16g","children":[]},{"id":"107","parent":"103","text":"Requiere soporte mecanico (ECMO V-A, IMPELLA, BIABIA)","guid":"jxaxOpFgQjO37jk-qSNR0g","children":[]}]},{"id":"108","parent":"82","text":"PRODROMO VIRAL","guid":"jnGbUtvLRy2Y_7QNyywaVg","children":[{"id":"109","parent":"108","text":"Presente en 50-70% de casos","guid":"WLc7-pr1RMKu8pA46reiYA","children":[]},{"id":"110","parent":"108","text":"Fiebre, mialgias, infeccion respiratoria alta 1-2 semanas previo","guid":"HV8yL6mxQgO92uYaDgd91A","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"111","parent":"0","text":"Diagnostico","guid":"6Iie3bhkRy-7iZlkJLUrAQ","children":[{"id":"112","parent":"111","text":"LABORATORIO","guid":"5nn1F5fIQcmXpkk1nTxY0w","children":[{"id":"113","parent":"112","text":"Troponina I o T (sensible, no especifica - debe solicitarse siempre)","guid":"xsdIVgpKQoSDbA5faBO9qg","children":[]},{"id":"114","parent":"112","text":"BNP / NT-proBNP (disfuncion ventricular)","guid":"IKImOks6R4KEE_xZ54zMlA","children":[]},{"id":"115","parent":"112","text":"PCR (inflamacion activa)","guid":"fp7JkN9qT_CCf8cYkroGUw","children":[]},{"id":"116","parent":"112","text":"VSG","guid":"wsnE_VTpRyKnv2gs-95G1Q","children":[]},{"id":"117","parent":"112","text":"Hemograma (leucocitosis, eosinofilia si hipersensibilidad)","guid":"5lZK-70rRICxnTeXMXKd0g","children":[]},{"id":"118","parent":"112","text":"Serologia viral (bajo rendimiento diagnostico en adultos, no rutinaria)","guid":"R0FwNr96RJKpfLIdVADO9g","children":[]},{"id":"119","parent":"112","text":"Panel autoinmune: ANA, anti-dsDNA, ANCA, anti-Ro/La (si sospecha autoinmune)","guid":"FiakRAQoROmEcuXhSWZlHw","children":[]},{"id":"120","parent":"112","text":"Clozapina: niveles + troponina en primeras 4 semanas de inicio","guid":"1Ga4rdTRRDyczrbui9HFuA","children":[]},{"id":"121","parent":"112","text":"ICI: troponina + BNP PREVIO a inicio y en cada ciclo","guid":"ZNUUAkNdQVuNGwMx7dEZkQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"122","parent":"111","text":"ECG","guid":"zvM6PbO4QYO6tK3Cn7YZ5g","children":[{"id":"123","parent":"122","text":"Taquicardia sinusal (hallazgo mas frecuente)","guid":"xXsP2-iWSmeHLWyfZINxUA","children":[]},{"id":"124","parent":"122","text":"Cambios inespecificos ST-T","guid":"dfULXYX9TRGisKDaM17LeQ","children":[]},{"id":"125","parent":"122","text":"Supradesnivel ST difuso (puede mimetizar SCA o pericarditis)","guid":"V5nVT78XRWKvHItoGwgung","children":[]},{"id":"126","parent":"122","text":"QRS bajo voltaje","guid":"txkpFlqTQOalvPEv3KWAZw","children":[]},{"id":"127","parent":"122","text":"Bloqueos de rama (derecha o izquierda)","guid":"xFYa04HySNeTdqGv3L-frA","children":[]},{"id":"128","parent":"122","text":"BAV de cualquier grado (Lyme: BAV completo en 5-10%)","guid":"5I9V91_wRa-jYrQTLvWipg","children":[]},{"id":"129","parent":"122","text":"Arritmias ventriculares","guid":"3kW_P9gKSSOLdItvtJXOTA","children":[]}]},{"id":"130","parent":"111","text":"ECOCARDIOGRAFIA","guid":"-_CvXN2MRVafrIjdmvaFxA","children":[{"id":"131","parent":"130","text":"PRIMER ESTUDIO A SOLICITAR","guid":"RXAG3LsJT52eAYKMdwLCUQ","children":[]},{"id":"132","parent":"130","text":"Disfuncion VI segmentaria o global","guid":"vl6RC7iuQwut2EHchkdqug","children":[]},{"id":"133","parent":"130","text":"FEVI deprimida (variable, puede ser normal en formas leves)","guid":"dxUc2-6rQYSHWSB1neeUHQ","children":[]},{"id":"134","parent":"130","text":"Derrame pericardico (miopericarditis ~20%)","guid":"U2V0y1YSS3atGPZLWo2YTQ","children":[]},{"id":"135","parent":"130","text":"Patron restrictivo en formas fulminantes (VI no dilatado pero muy disfuncionante)","guid":"_k7diHOmRtSzHv-Lyv9r6A","children":[]},{"id":"136","parent":"130","text":"Funcion VI aparentemente normal NO descarta miocarditis","guid":"E3Q12WxUTG-8t-OYjidllg","children":[]}]},{"id":"137","parent":"111","text":"RM CARDIACA (Gold standard no invasivo - Lake Louise 2018)","guid":"L2BB0jEmQNyxI9RmI9Cyuw","children":[{"id":"138","parent":"137","text":"CRITERIO T2: edema miocardico (T2 mapping elevado, razon >1.9)","guid":"N2QO9K0lSfm6Gly9d0tU8g","children":[]},{"id":"139","parent":"137","text":"CRITERIO LGE: lesion no isquemica","guid":"wCyCFFKzTxS1qjnqd8uEgQ","children":[{"id":"140","parent":"139","text":"Distribucion subepicardica o midmiocardia (NUNCA transmural como IAM)","guid":"u5vtn6KES0WIPaMU-4yQZQ","children":[]},{"id":"141","parent":"139","text":"Patron tipico: pared lateral VI en casos virales","guid":"3w-yZthMS8GDzUkPerfbXA","children":[]},{"id":"142","parent":"139","text":"Distribucion septal: sarcoidosis, Lyme","guid":"f36qzmctQK-1bYD_NUlgbA","children":[]}]},{"id":"143","parent":"137","text":"CRITERIO T1/ECV: elevacion de T1 nativo + volumen extracelular aumentado","guid":"RfgX1_8eQg6f8maCj2Wgew","children":[]},{"id":"144","parent":"137","text":"DIAGNOSTICO: 2 de 3 criterios = miocarditis probable","guid":"NzipgXTdRsGV4O9PJHUq7w","children":[]},{"id":"145","parent":"137","text":"SENSIBILIDAD ~80%, ESPECIFICIDAD ~87% (meta-analisis 2022)","guid":"Xt-MnumrSVWQMFuy2e2Row","children":[]},{"id":"146","parent":"137","text":"Limitaciones: costo, disponibilidad, no en inestables hemodinamicamente","guid":"LnIATTHBQCqYltPf-5mRZA","children":[]}]},{